      "rationale": "B01001 publishes 23 unequal age groups per sex; summing the declared lines gives 18 equal five-year groups, so a one-year group does not read as a dent in a pyramid (ADR-0013 rule 1). The broad groups and dependency ratios follow the Bureau's S0101 definitions (under 18, 18 to 64, 65 and over).",
